stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IDLE
    IDLE: ready=1, busy=0
    CONFIG: lock CSR and check configuration
    LOAD_IA: request LHS tile and fill IA cache
    LOAD_W: request RHS tile and fill weight buffer
    LOAD_BIAS: request bias and quant parameters
    COMPUTE: drive IA and weight streams to array
    REQUANT: convert int32 result to int8
    WRITE_BACK: send output data to DMA writer
    DONE: set done and writeback_valid
    ERROR: set error_code and clear busy

    IDLE --> CONFIG: start sampled and cfg_valid=1
    CONFIG --> LOAD_IA: configuration accepted
    CONFIG --> ERROR: illegal configuration
    LOAD_IA --> LOAD_W: ia_tile_ready=1
    LOAD_W --> LOAD_BIAS: weight_tile_ready=1
    LOAD_BIAS --> COMPUTE: bias_valid=1 or bias_disabled=1
    COMPUTE --> LOAD_IA: next reduction tile required
    COMPUTE --> REQUANT: final reduction tile complete
    REQUANT --> WRITE_BACK: output_fifo_valid=1
    WRITE_BACK --> DONE: all write responses returned
    LOAD_IA --> ERROR: dma_resp_error=1
    LOAD_W --> ERROR: dma_resp_error=1
    LOAD_BIAS --> ERROR: dma_resp_error=1
    WRITE_BACK --> ERROR: dma_resp_error=1
    DONE --> IDLE: clear_done sampled
    ERROR --> IDLE: soft_reset or clear_error sampled
